  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow> <msubsup> <mtext>I</mtext> <mn>3</mn> <mo>-</mo> </msubsup> </mrow> </math> ion is made by the addition of excess iodine to iodide solution.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>I</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mtext>I</mtext> <mo>-</mo> </msup> <mo>→</mo> <msubsup> <mtext>I</mtext> <mn>3</mn> <mo>-</mo> </msubsup> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Cs will always be in +1 oxidation state.",
